'''Wonder MOMOCO''' is a [[:Category:Legend Rare Cats|Legend Rare Cat]] that can be obtained at an extremely low chance when playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during [[THE DYNAMITES (Gacha Event)|THE DYNAMITES]] event. She was added in [[Version 8.2 Update|Version 8.2]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 15.5 Update#Version 15.5.1 Update|Version 15.5.1]] increases health, damage and freeze time, decreases cost, and grants [[Immune to Weaken|Weaken Immunity]], [[Immune to Freeze|Freeze Immunity]] and [[Colossus Slayer]].

